      "start": 1500,
      "details": "<p class=\"p1\">Amm\u0101 Ba\u1e25r-i F\u0101rs: Bir dery\u0101dur ki Ba\u1e25r-i Hind\u2019\u00fc\u00f1 \u015fim\u0101l\u012bsinden peyd\u0101\u00a0olur...\u00a0\u2018Um\u1e33\u0131 ya\u2018n\u012b derinligi yetmi\u015f, seksen \u1e95ir\u0101\u2018 anca\u1e33\u00a0vardur. Amm\u0101 uzun\u0131 on \u00fc\u00e7 bi\u00f1 iki y\u00fcz m\u012bld\u00fcr, dirler.</p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\">However,\u00a0<span>Ba\u1e25r-i F\u0101rs is a sea that emerges from the northern part of the Indian Sea... It is said that its depth is around seventy or eighty while its length is thirteen thousand two hundred miles. (Translated to English by the creator of the entry)</span></p>",
